            <description><![CDATA[<h4>Fixed</h4>
<ul>
<li>Calcite plain-text footer and CTA URLs now decode HTML-encoded ampersands.</li>
<li>Globe retains CTA links when a trailing period is included inside the link text.</li>
<li>Email Preview controls now use the app&#x27;s translucent control surface instead of a bright bar background.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
